senses.gloss:
वि-√ शङ्क् Ā. -शङ्कते, to be apprehensive or distrustful or uneasy, MBh.;
to be afraid of (abl.), Kathās.; BhP.;
to fear, apprehend (acc.), Śak.;
to mistrust (acc.), R.;
to doubt, suspect, MBh.; R.;
to believe a person to have or to be (two acc.), Gīt.;
 (with अन्यथा) to judge wrongly, misjudge, Śak. v, 17.

वि-शातय Nom. P. ˚यति, to hew in pieces, cut down or off, MBh.; R.;
to knock out (an eye), R.;
to scatter, dispel, remove, destroy, MBh.; R.

वि-षद् (√ सद्) P. -षीदति (impf. Class. व्य्-अषीदत्, Ved. व्य-षीदत्, or व्य्-असीदत्, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 119; pf. वि-षसाद, ib. 118; inf. -षत्तुम् or -षीदितुम्, MBh.),
to be exhausted or dejected, despond, despair, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to sink down, be immersed in (loc.), R. v, 95, 15 (perhaps वि-षेदुः w.r. for नि-ष्˚) :
Caus. -षादयति, to cause to despond or despair, vex, grieve, afflict, MBh.;
 B. &c.

वि-षञ्ज् (√ सञ्ज्) P. -षजति to hang on, hang to, attach, TS.; Kāṭh.;
 (-षज्जते), to be attached or devoted to, BhP. (pr. p. -षज्जत्, addicted to worldly objects, ib.; -षज्जन्ती f. devoted to a man, ib.);
to be stuck to or clung to, i.e. be followed at the heels by (instr.), ib.

विषमी—√ कृ P. -करोति, to make uneven, MBh.;
to make unequal or crooked, Śiś., Sch.;
to make hostile, BhP.

वि-षह् (√ सह्) Ā. -षहते (impf. व्य्-अषहत, or व्य्-असहत, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 71; inf. -षहितुम् or -सोढुम्, not -षोढुम्, ib., 115),
to conquer, subdue, overpower, be a match for (acc.), RV.; AV.; MBh.; Hariv.;
to be able to or capable of (inf.), MBh.; R.;
to bear, withstand, resist, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to endure, suffer, put up with (acc. also with inf.), R.; Gīt.; BhP. :
Caus. (only aor. व्य्-असीष-हत्), Pāṇ. viii, 3, 116 :
Intens. See वि-षासहि॑.

वि-सं-√ वद् P. -वदति, to break one's word or promise, Mn. viii, 219;
to fail in an agreement, contradict, raise objections, Kathās.; Kull. :
Caus. See -संवादित.
